 From: "Bob LeChevalier, President and Founder - LLG" <lojbab@lojban.org>
To: lojban@googlegroups.com=20
Sent: Wednesday, April 24, 2013 1:48 AM
Subject: Re: [lojban] Should I quit learning Lojban?
